          "id": "3815065489132086631",
          "type": "Video",
          "caption": "Moments that echo. Stories that connect. \n \nAnne Klein SS26 starring @tinakunakey and @carolineannkelley highlights The Invisible Thread between women, celebrating how shared experiences—big and small—bring us together in unexpected ways.\n \nShop the collection at AnneKlein.com and @macys",
