        {
          "id": "3846945121619829473",
          "type": "Sidecar",
          "caption": "Introducing The Artist Series by print designer @AnjelicaRoselyn. Anjelica’s bold, energetic prints come to life across limited-edition handbags, wallets, scarves, jewelry, and watches.⁠\n⁠\nThrough The Artist Series, we celebrate women shaping culture, and the threads that tie their stories to ours. ⁠\n⁠\nCreative expression, styled your way. Coming soon to anneklein.com.",
          "hashtags": [],
          "likesCount": -1,
