        {
          "id": "3844043469640099483",
          "type": "Sidecar",
          "caption": "Anne didn’t just design clothes—she designed confidence. Here’s to the women who lead with strength, style, and self-belief. We can’t wait to celebrate you all month long!",
          "hashtags": [],
