        {
          "id": "3844096036139258583",
          "type": "Video",
          "caption": "If you’ve been thinking about coming… this is your sign. On Wednesday (3/4), this room is holding the conversations most women only have in private about ambition, doubt, money, growth, becoming.\n\nIf you’ve been craving depth…\nIf you’ve been wanting to sit around women who actually say what they mean…\nIf you’ve been feeling like you need to get in a different room…\nThis is that room.\n\nFrom now until midnight tonight, we’re opening a BRINGHER pass.\nBuy your ticket and bring a woman who needs to be here for 50% off.\nThe friend who’s capable of more.\nThe one in a transition.\nThe one who needs to be reminded who she is.\n\nBecause the right rooms change you. But the right rooms with the right women? That’s when things click.\nIf you already grabbed your ticket, you’re the reason this is building the way it is. Thank you for trusting us early.\n\nIf someone’s on your mind, text her. Use code: BRINGHER\nEnds tonight at midnight.\nWednesday isn’t just a panel. It’s a shift. And once the room fills, that’s it.\n\nSee you there. 🤍\n\n#events #nyc #community #internationalwomensday #womenowned",
